              "node_type": "item",
              "title": "Densely Connected Convolutional Networks (2016)",
              "description": "[original code], introduces DenseNets and shows that it outperforms ResNets in CIFAR10 and 100 by a large margin (especially when not using data augmentation), while only requiring half the parameters. CVPR 2017 best paper.",
